                <pb facs="0730" n="610" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg610"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.00/309: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Riddle</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-09-29T12:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 29,
                                1922—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 3:20 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>61. Your 49, September 26, 5 p.m. Argentine Foreign Office states that the
                    President’s letter appointing me special representative at <pb facs="0731"
                        n="611" xml:id="pg611"/> the inauguration ceremonies of President-elect
                    Alvear should be addressed to President Irigoyen and requests that letter be
                    corrected accordingly. Please instruct.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Riddle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
